      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T19:27:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m curious: Is this something that recently broke w/ mainline? Or just recently narrowed to this patch?\n\nI\u0027m always happy to get rid of an ANDROID patch, and it may be that the fw_devlink support upstream made this unnecessary awhile back - but I\u0027d want Sarvana to confirm, as there may be other clk_sync_state users (from commit 44ee1179cbf8) that may be having trouble as well.",
      "revId": "95adafa96667e876e0ed1448a1cba691b03a7bab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "08c265a4_40abb1ef",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
