        "id": 1446383
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T19:41:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Those log messages generally happen if the clocks/GDSC aren\u0027t set up properly by the bootloader. I\u0027m pretty sure removing these would cause stability issues during boot up (just because it\u0027s booting up once doesn\u0027t mean there aren\u0027t race conditions).",
      "revId": "95adafa96667e876e0ed1448a1cba691b03a7bab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
