      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T19:44:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ha, this definitely seems like an issue with this upstream patch which is a recent change.\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/703db1f5da1e3a62b84356a29c150efa24a2377d\n\nBut since clk_sync_state() hasn\u0027t been upstreamed yet (I sent out v1 and haven\u0027t had time to get back to it), Bjorn didn\u0027t hit it.",
      "revId": "95adafa96667e876e0ed1448a1cba691b03a7bab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
